          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On May 4, 2008, around 4:30 AM, a witness observed the very fast movement of two bright points above the horizon for 10 seconds. A few seconds later, these points separated and turned in the opposite direction. No noise was heard. No other details were recorded about this phenomenon, for which we lack information.",
